🌋 08. AFAR DESERT & VOLCANO SAFARI
DANAKIL • ERTA ALE • DALLOL • SALT DESERT
Enter one of Ethiopia’s most extraordinary geological landscapes — a world of salt flats, volcanic terrain, geothermal formations, desert horizons and Afar cultural heritage.
